#. (itstool) path: plugin/_short
msgid "Keyboard Shortcuts Inhibit Protocol"
msgstr "键盘快捷键抑制协议"

#. (itstool) path: plugin/_long
msgid "An implementation of the keyboard-shortcuts-inhibit-v1 protocol."
msgstr "keyboard-shortcuts-inhibit-v1 协议的实现。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Inhibit by default"
msgstr "默认抑制"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Criteria for which apps to inhibit input for even though they do not request "
"it via the protocol."
msgstr "指定即使应用未通过协议请求，也对其抑制输入的条件。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Ignore views"
msgstr "忽略窗口"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid "Restrict matched views from activating shortcuts inhibit."
msgstr "限制匹配的窗口激活快捷键抑制。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Break current inhibitor"
msgstr "解除当前抑制"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid "A keybinding to remove the currently active inhibitor temporary."
msgstr "用于临时移除当前活动抑制的按键绑定。"
